{"2685450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Happy Color Links", "steam_appid": 2685450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Happy Color Links is an adorable Sokoban puzzle game where you link shapes of the same color together to make them happy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features over 75 handcrafted puzzles, divided into maps that function like small open worlds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore multiple interesting mechanics, including squares, circles, triangles, multipliers (producers), color splashes, power loops, and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose the world you want to visit from the lab and unlock new worlds by gathering black gems from previous worlds by solving puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can undo moves and undo puzzles through reset (undo each puzzle individually), ensuring a smooth gameplay experience. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe final world is a unique small meta world where you use resets and move shapes from one level to another to solve puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy talking to quirky characters when you need a break from puzzling; they can be quite funny at times.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHope you have fun!", "about_the_game": "Happy Color Links is an adorable Sokoban puzzle game where you link shapes of the same color together to make them happy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features over 75 handcrafted puzzles, divided into maps that function like small open worlds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore multiple interesting mechanics, including squares, circles, triangles, multipliers (producers), color splashes, power loops, and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose the world you want to visit from the lab and unlock new worlds by gathering black gems from previous worlds by solving puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can undo moves and undo puzzles through reset (undo each puzzle individually), ensuring a smooth gameplay experience. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe final world is a unique small meta world whe